  "body": "Add one zero-model SDK3 capture replay with durable per-capture, sensor, CPU-read and task-step boundaries plus 30-second Python stack dumps. Keep the 160-second child and 180-second container limits, preserve actual kill return codes, and distinguish an authenticated timeout observation from native rendering success.\n\nBased on PR133; all existing files remain unchanged. CPU tests cover original-call ordering/restoration, malformed traces, real harmless subprocess stack/kill behavior, source images, isolation/lifecycle negatives, and honest partial/complete replay outcomes. Focused81 tests and actionlint pass. Full exact-source CI, one fresh review and the new versioned actual request precede final observations. No model inference, renderer repair, original matrix promotion, publication or merge.\n",
